{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-futur","level":"B1","topic":"Zeitformen","title":{"de":"Futur I: werden + Infinitiv","bn":"Future tense: werden + Infinitiv"},"summary":"ভবিষ্যৎ: Ich werde morgen Deutsch lernen. Present tense-ও খুব স্বাভাবিক।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Topic 12-এ ভবিষ্যতের পরিকল্পনা, অনুমান এবং অন্যের বলা তথ্য প্রকাশ করা শিখবে।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"werden + Infinitiv","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich werde morgen Deutsch lernen.","en":"I will study German tomorrow.","bn":"আমি আগামীকাল জার্মান পড়ব।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"Structure: Subject + werden-এর সঠিক রূপ + অন্যান্য শব্দ + infinitive"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Subject","werden"],["ich","werde"],["du","wirst"],["er/sie/es","wird"],["wir","werden"],["ihr","werdet"],["sie/Sie","werden"]]},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Wir werden nächstes Jahr nach Deutschland reisen.","en":"We will travel to Germany next year.","bn":"আমরা আগামী বছর জার্মানিতে ভ্রমণ করব।"}]}]},{"heading":"Present tense দিয়েও ভবিষ্যৎ","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"ভবিষ্যতের পরিকল্পনা বোঝাতে German-এ present tense-ও খুব স্বাভাবিক:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Morgen fahre ich nach Dhaka.","en":"Tomorrow I am going to Dhaka.","bn":"আমি আগামীকাল ঢাকায় যাচ্ছি।"}]}]}],"part":1,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ morgen Deutsch lernen.","options":["werde","wird","werden"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ich → werde।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Du ___ morgen arbeiten.","options":["werdet","wirst","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"du → wirst।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ nach Berlin fahren.","options":["werde","werden","wird"],"answer":2,"explanation":"er → wird।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Futur-এ মূল verb কোথায় ও কোন রূপে?","options":["শেষে, infinitive","দ্বিতীয় স্থানে, conjugated","শেষে, Partizip II"],"answer":0,"explanation":"werden + … + infinitive (শেষে)।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Morgen fahre ich nach Dhaka.“ কোন সময় বোঝায়?","options":["অতীত","ভবিষ্যৎ (present tense দিয়ে)","এই মুহূর্তে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"present tense দিয়েও ভবিষ্যতের পরিকল্পনা বোঝায়।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir ___ nächstes Jahr reisen.","options":["werdet","wird","werden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"wir → werden।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-futur","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ morgen Deutsch lernen.","options":["werde","wird","werden"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ich → werde।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Du ___ morgen arbeiten.","options":["werdet","wirst","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"du → wirst।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ nach Berlin fahren.","options":["werde","werden","wird"],"answer":2,"explanation":"er → wird।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Futur-এ মূল verb কোথায় ও কোন রূপে?","options":["শেষে, infinitive","দ্বিতীয় স্থানে, conjugated","শেষে, Partizip II"],"answer":0,"explanation":"werden + … + infinitive (শেষে)।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Morgen fahre ich nach Dhaka.“ কোন সময় বোঝায়?","options":["অতীত","ভবিষ্যৎ (present tense দিয়ে)","এই মুহূর্তে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"present tense দিয়েও ভবিষ্যতের পরিকল্পনা বোঝায়।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-futur-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir ___ nächstes Jahr reisen.","options":["werdet","wird","werden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"wir → werden।"}]}